# Case 3: rds_recycle_bin_mode is off
#
ERROR HY000: Cannot execute recyclebin command, the recycle bin switch is OFF or rds_recycle_bin_skip_acl_check is ON.
ERROR HY000: Cannot execute recyclebin command, the recycle bin switch is OFF or rds_recycle_bin_skip_acl_check is ON.
ERROR HY000: Cannot execute recyclebin command, the recycle bin switch is OFF or rds_recycle_bin_skip_acl_check is ON.
ERROR HY000: Cannot execute recyclebin command, the recycle bin switch is OFF or rds_recycle_bin_skip_acl_check is ON.
